Functions/Modules Developed:

I developed the Reports module for the Municipal Financial Management System. The module includes:

Employee Report
Budget Report
Supplier Report
Asset Report
Municipal Summary Report
Reports Menu

The Employee Report calculates and displays the total number of employees, total salary expense, average salary, highest salary, lowest salary, highest paid employee and lowest paid employee.

The Budget Report calculates and displays the total allocated budget, total expenditure, remaining budget and the number of departments that are within or over budget. It also shows the budget status of each department.

The Supplier Report displays the total number of registered suppliers together with their names, emails, phone numbers and towns.

The Asset Report displays registered assets and calculates the total asset value, average asset value, most expensive asset and cheapest asset.

The Summary Report provides an overall summary of employee, budget, supplier and asset information.
